text = "Thanks for playing through the prototype!

This build is only a small glimpse of what's planned for Starspire Hunters. 
In future updates, you can expect:

• More Bosses with meaningful loot and rewards
• New biomes to explore
• Combat Class advancements and new abilities
• More monsters, gear, crafting, and progression systems

If you enjoyed your time with the game, please consider wishlisting 
Starspire Hunters on Steam and joining the Discord community to follow 
development and playtest future builds.

Your feedback directly influences the future of Starspire Hunters. 
Thanks for being a part of the journey and we'll see you in the tower!
"

